  "Heartbeat 'systole' frame: dim dark-red BG."
  "\e[48;5;52m ")

(def heart-shade-bright
  "Heartbeat 'diastole' frame: brighter pink-red BG that throbs in
   tempo with the heart-glyph swap below."
